                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Can you elaborate why this is a separate property from the SpeedLimit itself?  Is it just because Redfish does it that way?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Control/Processor.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 13,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ender",
                        "email": "andhsieh@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "Ender-Hsieh"
                    },
                    "message": "Not just because Redfish does it that way - they are independent control dimensions.\nA single property cannot express \"limited but not locked\" vs \"limited and locked.\""
                }
